Live recorder status page (hand-made, 2026-11-13). Host: rec-status.example.com (folder name stays "live"), through Aliyun ESA.

Host path /opt/1panel/www/sites/live  ==  /www/sites/live in the OpenResty container.

  index/            static root. index.html = the status page (served only with a session),
                    assets/ = Carbon CSS (carbon.css, trimmed from the "Carbon" design-system
                    artifact with tools/build-carbon-css.py), gate.css (sign-in, same look as
                    rec.example.com), live.css/live.js (status page), gate.js (ESA captcha),
                    theme.js, IBM Plex fonts (OFL), logo.svg, bg.jpg (placeholder background).
  gate/             Lua + template, not web-served:
    live_config.lua   ESA captcha 身份标 (captcha_prefix) and 场景ID (captcha_scene), session TTL, asset_v.
    gate.lua          rewrite phase, every request: ESA edge header; "/" only in exchange for a
                      one-time live_entry pass (captcha on every visit); /api/* needs live_sess
                      (browser-session, renewed by each poll, 10 min idle); /__gate/*, /assets/*,
                      /__ingest open.
    login.lua/.html   GET /__gate/login (Carbon sign-in with the ESA AI captcha).
    verify.lua        POST /__gate/verify. ESA verifies the captcha on this URI before forwarding
                      (ESA rule "需验签的接口" = rec-status.example.com/__gate/verify, POST, with
                      拦截空 Token ON: without it ESA checks nothing); we then set the signed
                      live_entry pass (60 s, single use). captcha_trust_esa in live_config.lua.
    logout.lua        /__gate/logout.
    ingest.lua        POST /__ingest from the agent on the recorder host (HMAC-SHA1 with
                      ingest_key over "ts.body", +-300 s, never older than the last one).
    status.lua        GET /api/status -> {serverTime, receivedAt, data}.
    cookie_key        root 600, random; rotate to end all open sessions.
    ingest_key        root 600; same value as PUSH_KEY in /etc/rec-status/agent.env on the
                      recorder host (203.0.113.10).
    edge_key          root 600; ESA must add request header "X-Live-Edge: <edge_key>" to
                      origin requests (ESA rule). Without this file the edge check is off.
  proxy/live.conf   locations + rewrite_by_lua (included by the server block).
  log/              access.log, error.log.
/opt/1panel/www/conf.d/rec-status.example.com.conf   server block (uses the *.example.com cert of site e5).
/opt/1panel/www/conf.d/00-live.conf          lua_shared_dict live_status (latest snapshot, in memory;
                                             the agent re-sends at least every 60 s).

Reload: docker exec 1Panel-openresty-XXXX openresty -t && docker exec 1Panel-openresty-XXXX openresty -s reload
Bump asset_v in live_config.lua and ?v= in index/index.html after editing assets.
Source of truth: this repository (status-site/).
